title The spot in the box
intro A part of the field will glow. Then pick its name.
hide names
hide ball

step
  caption Look at the field. One part will glow yellow.

step
  draw penalty-spot left
  duration 400

question
  prompt What is this little spot in the big box called?
  answer Penalty spot
  wrong Center circle
  wrong Goal area
  wrong Halfway line
  correct Penalty spot.
  why If the defending team fouls in their own penalty area, the other team may get a penalty kick from this spot.
